# Samasta agent quality checks

Working in `samasta-frontend` (app under `samasta/`):

1. Prefer Syncphony-style layout: utils (pure), composables (reactive), queries, constants, feature components.
2. After code changes, run from `samasta/`:
   - `pnpm lint`
   - `pnpm fmt:check`
   - `pnpm typecheck`
3. Fix all failures before finishing. Do not skip these checks.
4. If CSS or Nuxt config changed, also run `pnpm postinstall` (nuxt prepare).
5. See [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) and [samasta/README.md](samasta/README.md).
